# v0.0.0 — elder fraud by proximity, then bank rails
# United States v. Jamie Jakia Cofer, S.D. Fla. 9:20-mj-08273-DLB
# Criminal complaint and affidavit, CourtListener document 141451183
# https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/17415926/1/united-states-v-cofer/
# Account numbers, the iCloud address, and the phone number in the affidavit
# are not copied into this graph.
# Two concurrent methods. Charging allegations. Confidence 55.

@prefix cf: <http://example.org/kb/fraud-v0/cofer/> .
@prefix traj: <http://example.org/ontology/trajectories/> .
@prefix lay: <http://example.org/ontology/layered/> .
@prefix uco-core: <https://ontology.unifiedcyberontology.org/uco/core/> .
